### Day 1-2: Text Representation Fundamentals

#### The "Why"

Computers only understand numbers. To process text, we must convert words to numbers. The simplest approach (one-hot encoding) treats each word as independent. But "king" and "queen" ARE related! Word embeddings capture these relationships as dense vectors.

